OL,3,AOrganised crime arrests as police
OL,4,Ainvestigate Middlesbrough crash that
OL,5,Akilled two police officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwelve people have been arrested after
OL,8,Fa collision that killed seven people,
OL,9,Fincluding two police officers,
OL,10,FCleveland Police says
OL,12,FNine men and three women, aged 19 to
OL,13,F61, have been arrested across Teesside
OL,14,Fon suspicion of offences including
OL,15,Fparticipating in an organised crime
OL,16,Fgroup - read the police statement in
OL,17,Ffull
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
