OL,3,ABurnham vows support for Ukraine
OL,4,Adespite 'outrageous threats' from
OL,5,ARussia
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has agreed to hand over
OL,8,Fblueprints for British-made components
OL,9,Ffor the Scalp missile, a French version
OL,10,Fof the UK's Storm Shadow cruise missile
OL,11,F- allowing Ukraine to produce the
OL,12,Fweapon domestically.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
