OL,3,APrince Harry steps down from African
OL,4,Awildlife charity board
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has stepped down
OL,7,Ffrom the board of an African wildlife
OL,8,Fcharity whose rangers had been found to
OL,9,Fhave committed human rights abuses
OL,10,Fagainst indigenous people.
OL,12,FA spokesman for Prince Harry confirmed
OL,13,Fhe was stepping down after being
OL,14,Fpresident for the charity, African
OL,15,FParks, for six years before becoming a
OL,16,Fmember of its board of directors in
OL,17,F2023, but said he remains a "supporter
OL,18,Fof its mission".
OL,20,FLast year the organisation admitted
OL,21,Fhuman rights abuses were committed by
OL,22,Fits rangers in Congo-Brazzaville.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
