OL,3,ATens of thousands urged to evacuate as
OL,4,Awildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 90,000 people have been urged to
OL,7,Fevacuate their homes as a large
OL,8,Fwildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,10,FThe fire, which officials say was
OL,11,Fcaused by people, was first reported on
OL,12,FSaturday and windy conditions have
OL,13,Fcontributed to its spread - what we
OL,14,Fknow so far
OL,16,FA state of emergency has been declared
OL,17,Fin Washoe County, north-west Nevada, as
OL,18,FGovernor Joe Lombardo calls it an
OL,19,F"active and rapidly evolving situation"
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
