OL,3,ARussia's second-biggest online retailer
OL,4,Atargeted in Ukrainian strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarehouses belonging to Russia's
OL,7,Fsecond-largest online retailer have
OL,8,Fbeen hit by a wave of Ukrainian drone
OL,9,Fstrikes.
OL,11,FOzon said its logistics facilities in
OL,12,Fthe southern regions of Krasnodar,
OL,13,FDagestan, Stavropol and Adygea were on
OL,14,Ffire and several people had been
OL,15,Finjured following overnight strikes.
OL,17,FUkraine has for weeks struck sites
OL,18,Fbelonging to Wildberries, the country's
OL,19,Fbiggest online retailer, describing the
OL,20,Ffirm as a legitimate target because it
OL,21,Fsupplied components to the military,
OL,22,Fwhich Moscow denies.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
